─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

=== KAFKA TOPIC LAYOUT (real-world) ===

Topic: order.created
  Partition 0 → orders for user region US-EAST
  Partition 1 → orders for user region US-WEST
  (ordering guaranteed per partition, not globally)

Consumer Group: inventory-service
  Instance A reads Partition 0
  Instance B reads Partition 1
  (horizontal scale without coordination)

Dead Letter Queue: order.created.DLQ
  → Events that failed after N retries land here for manual inspection

─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

