- **Definition:** A React built-in that groups children elements without rendering an extra DOM node.
- **Keywords:** React.Fragment, shorthand `<>`, key prop, semantic HTML, wrapper-free grouping, JSX single root rule
- **Related:** `React.createElement`, list rendering with `.map()`, semantic HTML, CSS grid/flex layout, `React.Children`

