- **Definition:** Filters query results to return only unique row combinations across all selected columns.
- **Keywords:** deduplication, sort-based, hash-based, tuple uniqueness, COUNT DISTINCT, ROW_NUMBER
- **Related:** `GROUP BY`, `EXISTS`, `ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY ...)`, `UNION` (vs `UNION
