```plaintext
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
  SEARCH AUTOCOMPLETE — SYSTEM DESIGN BLUEPRINT
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

─── CLIENT LAYER ───────────────────────────────────
  Browser/App
    │  debounce(300ms) + cancel in-flight requests
    ▼
  CDN Edge Cache  ←── cache key = normalize(prefix)
    │  Cache HIT  → return immediately (~5ms)
    │  Cache MISS → forward to Suggestion Service
    ▼

─── SUGGESTION SERVICE (stateless, horizontally scaled) ──
  GET /suggest?q=sta&limit=10&uid=u42

  1. Normalize prefix  → lowercase, strip punctuation
  2. L1 Cache (in-process LRU, ~10ms)
     HIT  → return top-K
     MISS → query Redis Cluster
  3. Redis Cluster  (~20ms)
     Key: "suggest:sta"
     Value: sorted set (score=popularity) → ZREVRANGE
     HIT  → re-rank with personalization layer
     MISS → query Prefix Index Service (rare cold path)
  4. Personalization Re-ranker
     - boost terms matching user history
     - boost trending terms (real-time scores)
     - filter blocklist
  5. Return top-10 JSON

─── DATA STORES ────────────────────────────────────

  Redis Sorted Set per prefix shard:
    Key   : "suggest:{prefix}"        e.g. "suggest:sta"
    Member: "starbucks"
    Score : 0.7 * freq_score
          + 0.2 * recency_score
          + 0.1 * ctr_score

  Trie (in-process fallback / small-scale):
    Each node stores:
      char, children[26], topK: MinHeap<(score, term)>
    Space optimization:
      - Patricia/Compressed Trie to collapse single-child chains
      - Only store prefixes with freq > threshold

─── OFFLINE PIPELINE (runs every 1–6 hours) ────────
  Raw Logs (S3)
    → Spark Job: count query frequency per time window
    → Apply decay:  score = freq * e^(-λ * age_hours)
    → Compute CTR from click logs
