- **Q: What if the array may contain duplicates instead of a missing number?** A: Switch to a hash set or sort-then-scan approach; the math trick assumes distinct values and breaks silently with duplicates.
- **Q: Can this overflow in languages with fixed-width integers?** A: Yes — for very
