        { "field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/supportsHttpsTrafficOnly",
          "notEquals": "true" }
      ]
    },
    "then": {
      "effect": "Deny"          // Block non-HTTPS storage account creation
    }
  }
}

2. EFFECT TYPES (ordered by enforcement strength)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
Disabled            → Policy is off (testing)
Audit               → Log violation, allow resource   ← START HERE
AuditIfNotExists    → Audit if a related resource is missing
Append              → Add fields/tags to the request
Modify              → Add/replace tags or properties
Deny                → Block the ARM operation entirely
DeployIfNotExists   → Deploy a remediation resource if missing
              e.g., auto-deploy Log Analytics agent to every VM

