──────────────────────────────────────────────────
Management Group  (org-wide)
  └─ Subscription  (prod / dev / staging)
       └─ Resource Group  (app-team-a)
            └─ Resource  (individual VM, storage, etc.)

Assignments inherit downward; exclusions can be scoped upward.

