  ├─ Policy: Enforce MFA for subscription owners
  ├─ Policy: Allowed locations = [eastus, westeurope]
  └─ Policy: Require diagnostic logs on Key Vault
  
Assign one initiative → enforces all 100+ CIS controls simultaneously.

