 * What Azure Monitor captures out-of-the-box:
 * -----------------------------------------------
 * Metrics        → CPU, memory, disk I/O, network, latency (per-resource)
 * Activity Logs  → Control-plane ops (who did what, when) – 90-day retention
 * Resource Logs  → Diagnostic/data-plane logs (e.g., SQL slow queries, App GW access)
